    "Claude · 我的电脑": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude · My Computer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude 不选文件夹，电脑上显示 No folder": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude doesn't use folders, so the computer shows No folder."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude 可以归档和恢复，需电脑解锁；有工作副本的会话请在电脑上归档。暂不支持删除。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude conversations can be archived and restored, and require your computer to be unlocked. Archive conversations with working copies on your computer. Deleting isn't supported yet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude 想问你": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude has a question"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude 提议新开一个任务": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude suggests starting a new task"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude 的停止与队列动作需使用当前桌面令牌": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude stop and queue actions require the current desktop token."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude 问要不要新开一个对话": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude is asking whether to start a new conversation"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Codex 想问你": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Codex has a question"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Codex 有问题要问你": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Codex Has a Question for You"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Codex 的可以恢复，也可以勾选后删除；删除后电脑上也找不回来。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Codex conversations can be restored or selected for deletion; once deleted, they can't be recovered from your computer either."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DeepSeek 想问你": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "DeepSeek has a question"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DeepSeek 没有删除对话的功能，只能恢复。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "DeepSeek doesn't support deleting conversations, so they can only be restored."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DeepSeek 的工作区": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "DeepSeek Workspace"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DeepSeek 要选一个工作区": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose a workspace for DeepSeek"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Markdown 解析用苹果维护的 swift-markdown 0.9.0（Apache-2.0）和 swift-cmark 0.9.0（BSD-2-Clause）。Claude、DeepSeek 图形来自 Simple Icons（CC0），Codex 图形来自 SVG Logos（CC0）；这些标志归各自公司所有。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Markdown parsing uses Apple-maintained swift-markdown 0.9.0 (Apache-2.0) and swift-cmark 0.9.0 (BSD-2-Clause). The Claude and DeepSeek marks come from Simple Icons (CC0), and the Codex mark comes from SVG Logos (CC0). These logos belong to their respective companies."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "M月d日 HH:mm": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MMM d, HH:mm"
          }
        }
      }
    },
