    "一般不用改：默认连接 Teleply 的服务。自己部署了账号服务时，在这里填它的 HTTPS 根地址。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You usually don't need to change this. By default the app connects to Teleply's service. If you've deployed your own account service, enter its HTTPS root address here."
